    (0x5ab6cf, 'label', 'UpdateDispatchB_CallInputKick', 'UpdateDispatchB_CallInputKick [high] call InputWorkerKick 5AB7B0 at the END of the logic frame (FrameTask_Update -> FrameDtSetup -> UpdateDispatchB), i.e. BEFORE the QPC limiter in FrameEnd: the pad sample used by the next frame is taken here (stock). Site K / IK (E8 DC 00 00 00) | src: notes/input-latency.md §2; patcher/latency_live.fsx'),
    (0x5ab7b0, 'function', 'InputWorkerKick', 'InputWorkerKick [high] InputWorkerJoin(); reset pad-stage event (0x2f6ce8 on 0x45c39b0); KtglEventSet(g_InputUpdateWorker+8); g_InputWorkerPending = 1. Called once per frame from UpdateDispatchB | sig: void InputWorkerKick(void) | src: notes/input-thread.md §1'),
    (0x5ab7e0, 'function', 'InputWorkerJoin', 'InputWorkerJoin [high] if g_InputWorkerPending: KtglEventWait(g_InputUpdateWorker+0xa8); pending = 0 (GameModeUpdateMain and InputWorkerKick) | sig: void InputWorkerJoin(void) | src: notes/input-thread.md §1'),
