    (0x5ac664, 'function', 'FrameMgr_FrameBegin', "FrameMgr_FrameBegin [high] FrameMgr vtable vf[1] (frame task vf, 'frame begin'); stores now_ns to G+0x7D8 at 0x5AC6BE; computes dt60=G[624]*60/G[614] for early update 0x5AC9EC | sig: void FrameMgr::FrameBegin(FrameMgr* this) | src: notes/frame-timing.md §1 Loop diagram"),
