    (0x5ad229, 'label', 'FrameEnd_LimiterBegin', 'FrameEnd_LimiterBegin [high] QPC limiter start (range 0x5AD229..0x5AD2BB): fps=[r15+30], period=QPF/fps; draft P4 site orig 41 8B 4F 30 4D 8D 4F 10 (superseded by 0x5AD860) (aka FrameStepAndLimit_ComputeTicksPerFrame) || also: div = max(1,[r15+30h]); freq = [g_45BA780]->+18h; ticksPerFrame(rdi) = freq/div; last(r12) = [r15] | src: notes/frame-timing.md §1, §5 P4; notes/cpu-profile.md §S4'),
    (0x5ad292, 'label', 'FrameStepAndLimit_ReadNow', 'FrameStepAndLimit_ReadNow [high] now = QpcNow(205530); if now>last && now-last<ticksPerFrame -> cold spin block 19DF57E (aka FrameEnd_LimiterSpin) || also: QPC busy-wait loop: while (QPC-last < period) run a job or Sleep(0) via 0x916EBC | src: notes/cpu-profile.md §S4; notes/frame-timing.md §0, §1'),
    (0x5ad2bb, 'label', 'FrameStepAndLimit_StoreFrameTime', 'FrameStepAndLimit_StoreFrameTime [high] [r15] = now; frameDelta = (now-last)/freq | src: notes/cpu-profile.md §S4'),
    (0x5ad30b, 'label', 'FrameEnd_StoreGameDt', 'FrameEnd_StoreGameDt [high] movss [r15+18h],xmm1 (game-clock dt); draft P5 site orig F3 41 0F 11 4F 18, not needed | src: notes/frame-timing.md §5 P5, §4b'),
    (0x5ad5f8, 'function', 'FrameDtSetup', 'FrameDtSetup [high] Per-frame dt setup: G[614]:=G[618]; G[61C]:=old G[620]; G[618],G[620]:=GetTargetFps; G[624]:=G[628] (0 if paused); G[62C] 60 Hz accumulator; dispatches updates (dtSec=G[624]/G[614]); ctx[1E6]=max(1,G[614]/G[61C]); calls SetLimiterFps/SetProfile; hosts VRR P1 P2 P4 P9; no online condition (aka GameFrameUpdate) || also: Per-frame update: applies GameMain+0x618 to +0x614, re-reads REN_FPS cap, computes dt60 = scale*60/targetFps, feeds game-mode update (0x8c8e54, 0x5ab644), then runs DynFpsMonitorUpdate 0x5af410; 756 B | sig: void FrameDtSetup(FrameMgr* G) | src: notes/frame-timing.md §1, §3, §5-final; re/out/README.md §Findings: frame pacing'),
    (0x5ad677, 'label', 'VrrFps_P1', 'VrrFps_P1 [high] Nioh3EngineFix id P1 group VRR len 7 orig 44 89 87 14 06 00 00 (mov [rdi+614h],r8d) -> call caveFps + 66 90; rdi=G, r8d=tier, eax=old G[620]; writes measured fps_i to G[614], scaleCorr, ticks; applied last (aka FrameTimingPatchP1, ExtPatchSite_5AD677) || also: frame-timing patch P1 site (ft_vrr), disassembled by review_sites.fsx for flag/register reuse; listed in cpu_caves.fsx FT_SITES overlap check (see frame-timing notes for role) | src: mod/Nioh3EngineFix/patches.json; notes/frame-timing.md §5-final, §8.6; patcher/cpu_caves.fsx; patcher/review_sites.fsx; re/scripts_meshlet/meshlet_caves.fsx OTHER_SITES'),
