    (0x5ad860, 'label', 'VrrLimiter_P4', 'VrrLimiter_P4 [high] Nioh3EngineFix id P4 group VRR len 6 orig 8B 87 14 06 00 00 (mov eax,[rdi+614h] -> [rsp+20] SetLimiterFps arg) -> call caveLim + 90; limiter keeps tier/cap while armed (prevents self-lock); 0x5AD860..0x5AD898 range (aka FrameTimingPatchP4, ExtPatchSite_5AD860) || also: frame-timing patch P4 site (ft_vrr), disassembled by review_sites.fsx for flag/register reuse; listed in cpu_caves.fsx FT_SITES overlap check (see frame-timing notes for role) | src: mod/Nioh3EngineFix/patches.json; notes/frame-timing.md §4b, §5-final; patcher/cpu_caves.fsx; patcher/review_sites.fsx; re/scripts_meshlet/meshlet_caves.fsx OTHER_SITES'),
