    (0x5af410, 'function', 'DynFpsMonitorUpdate', 'DynFpsMonitorUpdate [high] Dynamic-FPS monitor: keeps 10-sample frame-timing ring (+0x08..+0x50), stores average at +0x74, then calls DynFpsGovernorTick (0x5af4d8); 211 B (aka FpsMonitorUpdate) || also: CPU-time monitor: now - G[7D8] into 10-sample us ring, average to mon+0x74 (CPU-only, ~8 ms at 60 fps menu; not the frame interval) | sig: void DynFpsMonitorUpdate(DynFpsState* s) | src: re/out/README.md §Findings: frame pacing; re/out/anchors.md §Interpretation notes; notes/frame-timing.md §1, §3'),
