    (0x5af50a, 'label', 'DynFps_SettingCheck', "DynFps_SettingCheck [high] cmp [0x45BAF58],r11d (DYNAMIC_FPS setting read); Nioh3Fix sig #21 'Dynamic FPS setting' (+3 rel). README says Nioh3Fix DynFPS hook sits 0x1C before a VRR site: matches this (P8b=0x5AF526), not the target hook 0x5AF5D2 (aka DynFpsGovernorTick_CheckDynamicFps, DynamicFpsGovernor_CheckDynamicFps) || also: Nioh3Fix site (menu framegen / DYNAMIC_FPS): cmp dword [0x45baf58],r11d (7 B); if DYNAMIC_FPS==0 sets Target=Cap and returns | Nioh3Fix hook site on the DYNAMIC_FPS check inside governor 0x5af4e4 | src: notes/frame-timing.md §3; notes/nioh3fix-signatures.md; mod/Nioh3EngineFix/README.md §Compatibility; re/out/anchors.md §site 0x5af50a; re/out/README.md §frame pacing"),
