    (0x1fe2fd4, 'function', 'SizeWorkerPools', "SizeWorkerPools [high] sizes the engine's 74 worker pools once at boot from the logical CPU count (clamped 6..32); with <13 logical CPUs it takes 3 threads from pool 3 (KIDS_RESOURCE) and pool 5 (StageUpdate) [Ghidra: 357 B, 1 callers] (aka SizeThreadPools) || also: Worker count = clamp(logical,6,32) (12 here), sizes 74 named pools from g_ThreadPoolTable 0x4b722d0; <=12 logical CPUs -> KIDS_RESOURCE and StageUpdate lose 3 threads each (P12 patch lifts it, no fps gain) | src: patcher/pool_patch.fsx; notes/settings.md §4.3; README.md §Second round"),
